flowchart TB
    S[Spec prompt] --> O[OpenSpec propose]
    O --> R{Review}
    R -->|adjust| O
    R -->|ok| I[Apply]
    I --> C[tsc + Vitest + Playwright]
    C -->|green| G[git commit on branch]
    G --> M[merge to main]
    M --> N[Netlify build<br/>prisma generate && next build]
    N --> L[Live URL]
    L --> Q[Smoke test: Alice → Bob → Carol]
